> To follow up on my earlier post: if you have multiple groups, you can use:
>
> ov.names <- lavNames(fit, "ov")
> PE <- parameterEstimates(fit)
> ev1 <- PE[ PE$op=="~~" & PE$lhs %in% ov.names & PE$lhs == PE$rhs &
> PE$group == 1,"est"]
> ev2 <- PE[ PE$op=="~~" & PE$lhs %in% ov.names & PE$lhs == PE$rhs &
> PE$group == 2,"est"]
>
> etc.
